{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03350","headline":"酬李丹徒见赠之作 · 宋之问","name":"酬李丹徒见赠之作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"镇吴称奥里，试剧仰通才。\n近挹人披雾，遥闻境震雷。\n一朝逢解榻，累日共衔杯。\n连辔登山尽，浮舟望海回。\n以予慙拙宦，期子遇良媒。\n赠曲南凫断，征途北雁催。\n更怜江上月，还入镜中开。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"宋之问","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03350.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03350","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}